From e050ea75d813260853a0d883414eee6a2945a0ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lalayang123456-ctrl <lalayang123456-ctrl@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 18:34:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add SO-ARM101 LeRobot driver and local evaluation
 support

Implement the SO101 adapter on LeRobot's so101_follower Feetech driver and
its RealSense/OpenCV cameras, and enable Local Policy evaluation for the
6-D joint_position contract (five joints in degrees, gripper 0-100).

- Clamp commands to configured joint limits; reject malformed actions.
- Return to the start pose before releasing torque on shutdown.
- Never start LeRobot's interactive calibration from an evaluation.
- Export state/action with LeRobot's motor names; no fabricated FK pose.
- Add the so101 extra, config example, guide and tests with fake hardware.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
